uncompromising look at a suburb in <num> century vienna mixing the stories of <num> groups of characters by former documentary maker u.seidl is a provocative minimalistic and intense piece of observation cinema   after the world wide spread of big brother reality shows hundstage takes modern voyeurism to an unsettling profound level hard to like but unignorable piece of european art cinema might seem cruel and seedy yet manages to convey the nihilistic alienated feeling of modern society in a praiseworthy manner   a must for lovers of world cinema 

