this is indeed the film that popularized kung fu in the 1970s however if it ever had any kind of excitement or even halfway interesting plot it does n't seem to have aged very well   long story short extremely drawn out slow moving confusing plot with run of the mill choreography typically annoying and exaggerated whiplash sounds with every punch and kick and constant plot twists that never come to an end by the time the film reaches its emotional climax i had long had all the wind knocked out of me to actually care   watch it for its historical value as a milestone of chinese kung fu cinema just leave your expectations at the door or you 'll be bitterly disappointed   for hardcore fans only 

