 have much experience with bad films but i know bad when i see it i could bounce back from mazes and monsters with a good old campy bruce willis comedy but not even bruce could cheer me up after this movie i have yet to see any ed wood or uwe boll but i think i 'm amped for them now for i ca n't even fathom a movie worse then gag hangmen 

