ar for the scene where the husband drives south from the bridge it cuts to a u turn in an unrelated parking lot and then he 's instantly back on the bridge driving north it takes a whole lot of something bravery ignorance deadlines to try and slip that <num> by the viewer during the <num> single car chase 

