d crazy but it makes the film better   another thing i forgot to mention is that the reason i do n't think the film did so well was maybe in my point of view because of the title talk radio it does n't sound very tricky or anything it 's kind of plain a better title like the book talked to death or maybe the abusive radio host or something catchy and not plain talk radio or maybe because of universal pictures oliver stone usually did n't do universal i do n't think paramount might have been a good company i do n't know something about this film did n't do so well but i love it   sticks and stones can break your bones but words can cause permanent damage 

